  "scope": [
    "The classifier covers positions in the mixed syntax tree. Embedded Wiring values are leaves: internal pure-wiring rewrites are not exposed as positions here.",
    "Root/root and nested overlaps are explicitly unresolved. Returning none does not establish semantic inequivalence or lack of a joining diagram.",
    "The catalogue is generic and may be infinite. Its finiteness/locality and a finite critical-overlap basis are not consequences of these data types.",
    "No mixed termination order, complete finite higher basis, global coherence, arbitrary higher pasting algebra, or equality of proof terms is proved.",
    "Charges are symbolic annotations. No general mixed-diagram event-security-bound contract, original certified computational-reduction interpretation, or actual native runtime/time contract has yet been connected.",
    "Tensor processes distinct input components with separate local randomness conditional on those values; arbitrary correlations in the input law are allowed. This does not duplicate a shared mutable oracle into independent oracles.",
    "The MAC wiring duplicates finished sampled outcome values. Native alias-preserving live oracle-handle continuation after copy is not newly implemented.",
    "The original MAC attack, query order, full state/trace, and existing 1/256 security assumption are reused. No new cryptographic bound is claimed.",
    "Declared support is conservative. No semantic minimality, optimal fresh-condition count, total repair-time bound, or ordinary-proof performance separation is proved.",
    "The checked updated-model local-rule contract is an explicit premise; its verification/generation cost is not hidden inside a guard-intersection complexity claim."
  ],
